# PendingBot Admin (board console) — environment.
# Copy to `.env` for local dev. In prod the SPA is bundled into the edge
# worker's static assets (served at bot.pendingname.com/board); this var is
# inlined at build time. Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to client code.
#
# Auth is Cloudflare Access (same-origin cookie) — no Supabase/Turnstile keys.

# Edge API base URL. Same origin as the board page so the Access cookie is sent.
VITE_EDGE_API_URL=https://bot.pendingname.com
